{"id":"d93b9783-5b1d-427a-a3d7-437264da6f54","expr":"args != null","rationale":"The main args array is typically non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.374895Z"}
{"id":"c47a19e1-e47b-41d9-b5ca-e78209517e5f","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty() || name.length() == 0","rationale":"If name is not null, length is >= 0; covering empty string case.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.375546Z"}
{"id":"e985440f-be9d-4114-9bfd-8e47232faf91","expr":"args != null","rationale":"Java main method args is never null but can be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.377803Z"}
{"id":"a6106c4c-c692-4783-8190-50eee53219af","expr":"args.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.377803Z"}
{"id":"ed5d79b5-6cee-4390-b333-ee0976dbc7ce","expr":"args.length <= 1000","rationale":"Typical main args length is small, so an upper bound of 1000 is plausible.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.377803Z"}
{"id":"bb31501a-3d8b-4087-bd6c-2f69844ef096","expr":"name == null || result >= x","rationale":"If name is not null, result is x plus name.length(), so result is at least x.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.378317Z"}
{"id":"e5028d52-d325-4cb6-b36e-996f31c3edc6","expr":"args.length == 0 || args[0] != null","rationale":"Args elements are usually non-null if present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.377803Z"}
{"id":"693a6729-be16-45da-a919-c34097fc8f85","expr":"name != null || result == -1","rationale":"If name is null, method returns -1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.378317Z"}
{"id":"3688157b-2041-44a4-807f-0e72774561e8","expr":"name != null || result <= 0","rationale":"If name is null, result is -1, which is <= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.378317Z"}
{"id":"e42ec105-4191-4d90-8bf1-0120993f144f","expr":"result == -1 || result >= x","rationale":"Result is either -1 if name is null, or at least x otherwise.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.378317Z"}
{"id":"0d99e3c2-2cbc-4377-9dcd-cdf202cfff0e","expr":"name == null || result == x + name.length()","rationale":"When name is not null, result equals x plus name's length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-01-08T07:16:14.378317Z"}
